  title: THE SECRET HERETIC
  description: My Pontiff! Dreadful news! Our eyes in the Pink Quarter have revealed
    that one of our clerics is, may the Beholder forgive my tongue, a heretic! Somehow,
    he managed to be anointed as one of our own without believing a single word he
    preaches. We must deal with this blasphemer before his secret comes to light.
